# Sample 16 — Style customization
#
# The four `style` properties are independent singletons — each may
# appear once, in any combination — not one shared "style" statement.
# This is the spec's own §Styling example, given a diagram to sit in.

diagram "Custom styling" {
  style theme print
  style palette high-contrast
  style zones full
  style connections rows

  below "Emergency load" must 5 kA margin 10%
  above "Minimum fault" must 8 kA margin 10%

  selected "Setting" midpoint step 0.05 kA
}
